{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold Steel is homage to the classic RTS style of C&amp;C, AOE and StarCraft, but with a wicked twist...\u00a0 Your structures and units are completely autonomous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You craft the behavior of your units using an innovative visual coding interface.\u00a0 Create intelligence and battle awareness through your own creative logic.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources and battery power to design the perfect autonomous war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic can be simple and straightforward, or you can evolve into complex inter-relationships where your units can trigger behavior changes in other units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outmaneuver the enemy and claim victory?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791780?t=1770858085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791780/ce537c9db0788aa133bc065f62087643159fdf6c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770858085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791780/e1d66b41bd98d89820e50fede276add15af8e623/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770858085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791780/e1d66b41bd98d89820e50fede276add15af8e623/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770858085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p c